ng uh fake news basically  favorable to the marcos but there has  been you know the public has picked up  on this the average filipino many  ordinary filipinos have taken through  this messaging and are themselves  spreading uh these bits of  disinformation like wildfire on social  media  two weeks to go until the election on  election day we i'm sure we'll be  speaking again journalist jessica in  manila thanks so much

